# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Everything here is baked into the front-end
# bundle at build time, so nothing secret belongs in this file.

# Where the scene 07 contact form posts. Point it at the deployed endpoint:
#   https://<your-service>.onrender.com/api/contact
# Left empty, the form says so rather than silently dropping the message.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

# The endpoint's own secrets (RESEND_API_KEY, CONTACT_TO_EMAIL and friends) are
# not read here — they live in the host's environment. See `server/index.js`
# and `render.yaml`.
